{"name":"Nose exercises (nose yoga)","deep":true,"image":null,"mentions":0,"casual":{"lead":["Nose exercises are muscle routines such as nostril flaring that proponents say can slim the nostrils or lift the tip.","No published studies were found on whether they change nose shape."],"sections":[{"h":"How it works","paras":["Proponents say exercising the small muscles around the nose changes its shape. The nose's main structure is bone and cartilage, which these muscles do not directly reshape."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Risks and caveats","paras":["No documented harms specific to the practice were found."],"subs":[]}]},"gallery":[],"links":{"studies":[],"trials":[],"label":null,"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"Flame Free Confession III: Even More Flame Free (Part 2)","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/flame-free-confession-iii-even-more-flame-free-part-2/273731","site":"T Nation · 8490 posts · 2021"},{"title":"Per aspera ad astra (strongman Koestrizer)","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/per-aspera-ad-astra-strongman-koestrizer/213205","site":"T Nation · 8404 posts · 2015"},{"title":"TM79's Training Journal","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/tm79s-training-journal/273630","site":"T Nation · 4246 posts · 2021"},{"title":"Atlas13 Burning the Boats","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/atlas13-burning-the-boats/259312","site":"T Nation · 3714 posts · 2019"},{"title":"Wisey's Training Log - StrongEveryDay","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/wiseys-training-log-strongeveryday/276826","site":"T Nation · 2456 posts · 2022"},{"title":"Home Shed Gym 5/3/1 - Focusing on the Iron","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/home-shed-gym-5-3-1-focusing-on-the-iron/271881","site":"T Nation · 1902 posts · 2021"},{"title":"Just. Don't. Suck. Vol. 2","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/just-dont-suck-vol-2/273858","site":"T Nation · 1734 posts · 2021"},{"title":"Kdjohn: Physical Philosophy & Iron Insights","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/kdjohn-physical-philosophy-iron-insights/261485","site":"T Nation · 1711 posts · 2019"},{"title":"Sky